# P19 Remesh (UE URemeshMeshTool, MeshOps palette "Mesh"): a 32x32 lat-long Sphere from Modeling > Shapes, Wireframe;
# Mesh tool: Remesh with Use Target Edge Length at 20 cm (UE defaults otherwise: Smoothing 0.25, 20 iterations,
# Reproject), Preserve Sharp Edges off so the UV seams and pole fans may collapse too (UE bAllowSeamCollapse) ->
# Accept (one undo step) -> Undo.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Wireframe"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.6,-0.53,0.6
Дано run Modeling "Create shape pivot: Centre"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape sphere: Lat Long"
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.HorizontalSlices 32
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.VerticalSlices 32
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Когда run Modeling "Remesh: Use Target Edge Length: on"
Когда --subject modeling set Remesh.TargetEdgeLength 20
Когда run Modeling "Remesh: Preserve Sharp Edges: off"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh tool: Remesh"
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Когда state
Тогда 0_remesh an even isotropic triangle mesh (uniform triangles about 20 cm, no long slivers or fans at the poles), the shape still a sphere; the status reads "Remesh: N triangles, edge length 20.00 cm ..."
Когда run Action Undo
Когда state
Тогда 1_undo the original 32x32 UV-sphere triangulation back (pole fans, latitude rings)
